{"rank": 1234, "word": "pesar", "display": "to weigh / regret", "pos": "verb", "difficulty": "B1", "tags": ["curated"], "notes": "As verb: pesar = to weigh (¿Cuánto pesas? = How much do you weigh?). As noun: un pesar = a regret/sorrow. A pesar de = despite/in spite of — one of the most useful Spanish phrases.", "glosses": ["weigh", "regret", "sorrow", "despite"], "examples": [{"es": "A pesar del frío, salimos a caminar.", "en": "Despite the cold, we went out for a walk."}], "linguistic": {"infinitive": "pesar", "gender": null, "plural": null, "irregular": false, "register": "neutral", "reflexive": null, "ipa": "/peˈsaɾ/", "syllables": ["pe", "sar"], "conjugation_class": "regular-ar", "overrides": {}}, "relations": {"commonly_confused_with": [], "related": ["peso", "lamentar", "aunque"], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": []}, "frequency": {"corpus_frequency": 24982, "band": "B1"}, "domains": ["everyday", "emotion"], "register": "neutral", "lang": "spanish", "source": "curated", "needs_review": false}
{"rank": 1235, "word": "absoluto", "display": "absolute", "pos": "adjective", "difficulty": "B1", "tags": ["curated"], "notes": "En absoluto = not at all (a very common phrase): ¿Te molesta? — En absoluto = Does it bother you? — Not at all. Poder absoluto = absolute power. Silencio absoluto = complete silence.", "glosses": ["absolute", "total", "complete", "utter"], "examples": [{"es": "¿Te importa si me siento aquí? — En absoluto.", "en": "Do you mind if I sit here? — Not at all."}], "linguistic": {"infinitive": null, "gender": null, "plural": null, "conjugations": null, "irregular": false, "register": "neutral", "reflexive": null, "ipa": "", "syllables": []}, "relations": {"commonly_confused_with": [], "related": ["total", "completo", "relativo"], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": ["relativo", "parcial"]}, "frequency": {"corpus_frequency": 24982, "band": "B1"}, "domains": ["everyday", "philosophy"], "register": "neutral", "lang": "spanish", "source": "curated", "needs_review": false}
